title: 'projr: Facilitate Reproducible and Archived Projects'
version: 0.6.1
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.18402379
abstract: Run R scripts and render 'Quarto', 'R Markdown' and 'bookdown' documents
  in a configured order. Record file hashes for each version of an analysis, archive
  its inputs and outputs locally or in 'GitHub' releases, and restore the inputs for
  a checked-out version.
